Z||000004||chester||09-13-2001||06:43 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackDragon:<BR><B>i know of a place on line that sells a kit similar, but they come with clear covers..... i will look for the site, if i find it, i will post it here.  <P>to those who have these headlights: can you see well at night with them? or does it limit your light? <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I think the other set you are talking about is from Gary's Custom Exotics. They use round halogens (I Think) and have the lexan cover but are more $$$ and I personally didn't like the look of the lights they use.  The light pattern that Toms light throw is decent just make sure that you adjust them properly.  I've had them on my car now for about 2 months and haven't had anyone harass me about them yet (even though I do thend to attract the attention of the local police a lot  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> )<P>Hope this helps.<P>Rob D.<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigline.jpg">   <BR>Modified 2.8<BR>2.5" Drop<BR>11" Brakes<BR>17" Revolutions<BR>RCC Coilover Suspension||||reg||6
